    "updated_at": "2025-01-27T19:53:41Z",
    "body": "Hiding because I think I got confused and this isn't useful.\n\n> I think the specification is very clear. False has no effect.\n\nI don't think that is clear personally. I'm also not sure that matches implementations?\n\nEdit: Actually this may be me misreading what you mean.\n\nI read this as \n\nfocusVisible == true - show focus ring\nfocusVisible == null && UA defined algorithm - show focus ring\n\nOtherwise don't show a focus ring.\n\nSo focusVisible being false has the effect of disabling the UA defined algorithm?",
